      "message": "Thanks. So for read-write should \u0027is_fixed_read_only` be rmeoved or be set to false?\n\nAlso, are there any other differences in the way it is used? For instance I\u0027m simply accessing it via `flag_name()` function. Will that work with read-write as well?",
