      "writtenOn": "2025-01-21T13:55:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e So for read-write should \u0027is_fixed_read_only` be rmeoved or be set to false?\n\nEither way is fine. I prefer removing it.\n\n\u003e Also, are there any other differences in the way it is used? \n\nYou may refer to https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/14IUCn3DkNlyZ05CsD_CHOkwcDtCqWie0kXhudNAeXFU/edit#slide\u003did.g211eaaff9fe_0_128 for the difference between read-only and read-write flags, as well as the caveat. In a nutshell, by moving to a RW flag, you\u0027ll lose the macro but the function will still be there.",
