      "writtenOn": "2025-01-21T06:46:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, it doesn\u0027t have to be done every time. For young collections GarbageCollector::Run() will always call YoungMarkCompact::RunPhases(). So this binging of young-GC metrics to YoungMarkCompact\u0027s instance is permanent for the runtime\u0027s lifetime.",
